    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854640/extras/e058163700818459c2f3aaa0fbf8e142.avif?t=1742155948\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Etheriia - Chapter 1 arrives on 28/03/2025 - and it's free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interdimensional journey of <i>Etheriia - Travelogue</i> is about to begin! After months of development, <strong>Chapter 1</strong> will be released for free on <strong>March 28, 2025</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c An adventure full of mystery, sensuality and interdimensional challenges <br>\ud83d\udd0d A preview of the <strong>Complete Edition</strong>, scheduled for September 2026 <br>\ud83c\udfad Outstanding characters and an engaging story</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why are we releasing it for free?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many players as possible to explore this universe and help us shape the next chapters with feedback and suggestions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Complete Edition is coming soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 F <strong>ull release: September 2026</strong> <br>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Those who download the demo will get a <strong>special discount</strong> on the final version</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support the project and unlock exclusive content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help the development, you can support and get <strong>early access to exclusive scenes and content</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the journey!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854640/extras/e058163700818459c2f3aaa0fbf8e142.avif?t=1742155948\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Etheriia - Chapter 1 arrives on 28/03/2025 - and it's free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interdimensional journey of <i>Etheriia - Travelogue</i> is about to begin! After months of development, <strong>Chapter 1</strong> will be released for free on <strong>March 28, 2025</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c An adventure full of mystery, sensuality and interdimensional challenges <br>\ud83d\udd0d A preview of the <strong>Complete Edition</strong>, scheduled for September 2026 <br>\ud83c\udfad Outstanding characters and an engaging story</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why are we releasing it for free?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want as many players as possible to explore this universe and help us shape the next chapters with feedback and suggestions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Complete Edition is coming soon!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 F <strong>ull release: September 2026</strong> <br>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f Those who download the demo will get a <strong>special discount</strong> on the final version</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support the project and unlock exclusive content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help the development, you can support and get <strong>early access to exclusive scenes and content</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the journey!</strong></p>",
